    given-names: Dominik
    email: dominik.ludera@mail.concordia.ca
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Computer Science and Software Engineering,
      Concordia University, Montreal, QC, Canada
  - family-names: Kersten-Oertel
    given-names: Marta
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Computer Science and Software Engineering,
      Concordia University, Montreal, QC, Canada
license: MIT
# The MIT licence above covers this repository's own code only. Parts of the
# tree are third-party MIT/Apache-2.0 code, the committed prediction dumps and
# fold assignment are ODC-By 1.0 derived data, and the released FastViT ONNX
# graphs derive from Apple's weights under Apple's own terms. See LICENSE and
# THIRD_PARTY.md.
